wards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(16)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202206171625342980213.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"PCM Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      pcmarket.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>PCM Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM features the fourth-generation QD-OLED panel, debuting in 2025, with a high pixel density. The 27&quot; 4K display achieves 166 PPI and a 240Hz refresh rate, enhancing text readability. At the same time, it maintains a compact form factor, making it more convenient to set up in a bedroom or study, creating a personal workspace or entertainment center.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>02/14/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Media review Award of PCM Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.pcmarket.com.hk/rog-swift-oled-pg27ucdm-rtx-50-4k240/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1340/202507020633208360511.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editors Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Magazine\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editors Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With excellent visuals and low input lag, the PG27UCDM proves that it’s an all-around excellent pick for all types of games. Fast-paced shooters, slow-paced RPGs, and everything in between will look good and play flawlessly on the monitor. Asus has outdone itself with this Editors' Choice winner, delivering just about everything we want out of a gaming monitor in its price range.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>USA</span> <span>05/30/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Media review Award of Editors Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.pcmag.com/reviews/asus-rog-swift-pg27ucdm?test_uuid=02LlF0iWKsilxYTJVF8uH5y&amp;test_variant=A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1340/202005121538499520852.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Toms Hardware Editors Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Tom's Hardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Toms Hardware Editors Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you want the very best OLED technology has to offer, the Asus ROG Swift PG27UCDM should be on your short list. It does everything well and stands out with Dolby Vision support and incredible pixel density.During my time with the PG27UCDM, I could find nothing to complain about. It serves incredibly well for gaming, entertainment and work and makes those activities a pleasure. Gameplay has the addictive quality I’ve come to expect from any fast OLED and that high pixel density is something you\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>USA</span> <span>05/08/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Media review Award of Toms Hardware Editors Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.tomshardware.com/monitors/gaming-monitors/asus-rog-swift-pg27ucdm-4k-240-hz-qd-oled-gaming-monitor-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1340/202405130908039340203.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"PC World Editors Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC World\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>PC World Editors Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      On the whole, the PG27UCDM delivers a wonderful SDR image that’s sharp, immersive, and accurate. Although it’s ideal for movies and games, the monitor’s 4K resolution and good color accuracy make it an equally great pick for creative professionals. \nThe Asus PG27UCDM is unique in offering optional HDR brightness control. It’s great to see.\nAsus’s ROG Swift PG27UCDM is a solid 4K QD-OLED monitor. In addition to excellent image quality, it provides many extras including HDR brightness control, Dol\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>USA</span> <span>02/28/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Media review Award of PC World Editors Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.pcworld.com/article/2621265/asus-rog-swift-oled-pg27ucdm-review.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202507141052094320060.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Red Dot Award 2025\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Red Dot\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Red Dot Award 2025</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The design of the ROG Swift OLED 27/32 monitor series combines a technology-orientated design with futuristic lighting accents.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>07/28/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Media review Award of Red Dot Award 2025\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.red-dot.org/zh/project/rog-swift-oled-27-32-series-82379\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202502281836185510895.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardwareluxx Excellent Hardware\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardwareluxx\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardwareluxx Excellent Hardware</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      All in all, the ASUS ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM is impressive across the board.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>02/27/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Swift OLED PG27UCDM Media review Award of Hardwareluxx Excellent Hardware\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareluxx.de/index.php/artikel/hardware/monitore/65467-asus-rog-swift-pg27ucdm-im-test-hochaufl%C3%B6sender-qd-oled-mit-vollausstattung.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202502201811539540406.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\" PCGH: Top product\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      pcgameshardware.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p> PCGH: Top product</p></div> <p class=\"Prod